    "chunk_size_bytes": 1740,
    "chunk_text": "\u0b85\u0ba4\u0ba9\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb1\u0b95\u0bc1, \u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd \u0b85\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0bbe\u0b9a\u0ba9\u0ba4\u0bcd \u0ba4\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bcd\u0bb1\u0bc1 \u0b85\u0b95\u0bb2\u0baa\u0bb5, \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bcd \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd [\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b85\u0bc7\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bcd \u0bb0\u0bbe\u0bc7\u0baa\u0b95\u0bcd\u0bb7] \u0ba4\u0b95\u0bb2\u0b95\u0bae \u0bb5\u0b95\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbe\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd.\n\nWhereupon THE HON. SPEAKER left the Chair, and DEPUTY SPEAKER [THE HON. AJITH RAJAPAKSE] took the Chair.\n\nDuring the Mahinda Rajapaksa era, very unfortunately, there was no consideration of the North and the East at all. On the contrary, there was cronyism. So, you had Members of Parliament who represented the North and East and loyal to that Government doled out a few hundred million rupees in order for them to secure their vote bank. They pretended as if they were doing some sort of development work. When the Ranil Wickremesinghe-Maithreepala Sirisena Government came into power in 2015, you had the TNA in the Opposition giving them, more or less, unconditional support and despite that, when the Budgets were presented, again, the Government were completely silent about the North and the East. There was nothing about the North and the East in those Budgets and when pressure mounted - I presume the TNA would have brought some pressure to get some things cleared because they found that they could not go back and face their electorate - the then Government made an announcement saying that the North and the East had not been specifically mentioned because the Government plans to have an international conference of donors in order to raise funds for the development of the North and the East.\n\n1181 1182\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dc1\u0dda\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0"
  },
