    "md5": "6e1cbfc3bb8932dab18a5d0e931cc6b2",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2022,
    "chunk_text": "the poor who rely heavily on the public health sector for their health needs. It is, therefore, most welcome that the President has paid attention to the needs of this sector with several proposals which will help improve the situation.\n\nMadam, I entered politics from the Colombo Municipal Council and I am quite aware of the hardships undergoing by the tenants in the Colombo City. With the increase of the cost of living, most of them are unable to pay their rents and it would be a dream for them to have a house of their own. The most progressive Proposal spelled out in this Budget is the transfer of ownership of all those houses and condominium parcels in the country owned by the UDA, the NHDA and the Government to the tenants free of charge, exempting the house rent payable by them in respect of those properties to the Government or any other institution. This Proposal will give relief to more than 50,000 tenants within the Municipal Council limits of Colombo. As a former Mayor of Colombo and a Parliamentarian from the Colombo District, I am aware of the difficulties of the poorer segments of society. The President\u2019s announcement that the occupiers of the Government-owned apartments, who currently pay a monthly rent of around Rs. 3,000 per month, will no longer have to pay such rents and that the ownership of such houses will be vested in them has been welcomed by the people.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dcf\u0dc3\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dd6\u0daa \u0db8 \u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0db8\u0dd2\u0dba (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0ba4\u0b95\u0bb2\u0b95\u0bae\u0ba4\u0bbe\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bcd \u0b89\u0bb1\u0bc1\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Presiding Member) Hon. Member, please wind up now.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0d92.\u0d91\u0da0\u0dd2.\u0d91\u0db8\u0dca. \u0dc6\u0dc0\u0dd4\u0db1\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b8f.\u0b8e\u0b9a\u0bcd.\u0b8e\u0bae\u0bcd. \u0ba4\u0baa\u0bcc\u0bb8\u0bbf) (The Hon. A.H.M. Fowzie) Please give me one more minute, Madam.\n\nThese Proposals will also empower those occupants and enable them to raise funds for any economic venture they may wish to undertake by mortgaging the houses."
  },
