    "chunk_size_bytes": 1963,
    "chunk_text": "[6.09 p.m.] \u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dba \u0dad \u0daf\u0dd2\u0dc3\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bae\u0baf\u0ba8\u0bcd\u0ba4 \u0ba4\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95) (The Hon. Mayantha Dissanayake) Hon. Presiding Member, I have the honour of seconding the Adjournment Motion brought in by my dear Friend, the Hon. Buddhika Pathirana, on the need of a National Evaluation Bill today.\n\nWe had a Standing Committee presided over by the Hon. J.M. Ananda Kumarasiri and I had the privilege of chairing the Subcommittee which drafted that Bill. So, we drafted the Bill; the Bill is ready. The Hon. Shehan Semasinghe knows that we only have to present it to the Cabinet, get the Cabinet's sanction, bring it to Parliament and after adopting any amendments that have to be made to that Bill, it can be passed by Parliament. It is not a difficult task and it is a task that has to be done. At this stage especially as a country which has declared itself bankrupt, it is absolutely, fundamentally required for us to bring this Bill to Parliament and adopt it.\n\nSir, I wish to take a minute to stress the importance of such a Bill. On any projects that are to be done in the future, the Government expenditure and the expected revenue should be evaluated.\n\nThe need of the country will have to be put first before any political will. It shows why such a project is required, why we need to spend so much money on a project of that nature. So, Sir, I urge the Government at this moment in time not to delay that. Look at this Bill as a Bill of national importance and bring it to Parliament as early as possible. The Leader of the Opposition, the Hon. Sajith Premadasa, has also pledged his support for such a Bill. So, I think this Bill could be passed in Parliament with a majority, certainly, with two-thirds of the Members of Parliament agreeing to it. We really do\n\n1297 1298\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dc1\u0dda\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0\n\nrequire this Bill, that I cannot stop stressing the need for such a Bill."
  },
  {
