    "chunk_text": "rights, deny their rights and their due place. So, by carrying on doing that, you know that you will keep making enemies, you know that that population will be hostile and for that reason, you need to maintain carrying out your racist agenda of dismantling the existence of the North and the East on a Tamil identity basis, and to sinhalize the North and the East, you need an oppressive structure, a structure that can continue to make the people of the North and the East subservient.\n\nI was just looking at the Recurrent Expenditure for defence. It is an exorbitant amount! Last year, Verit\u00e9 Research has carried out a research, where, they say, 48 per cent of the salaries was for defence and public security, together; of the entire expenditure on salaries in the entire Island, 48 per cent was defence-related. Can you justify that? And I will tell you why that is happening, Sir. On the one hand, you have done nothing to empower the people of the North and the East economically. Despite the fact that in 2009 when the war came to an end, they were 30 years behind economically, you have done nothing to empower them. You did nothing; not only the present Government, but even the 2015 Government did nothing. So, you keep them pauperized, those people become desperate and then, what do you do? Then, your counter-insurgency is to somehow absorb them into your own salary scheme. What salary scheme? Your defence salary scheme. That is happening and it is systematic."
