    "chunk_size_bytes": 2200,
    "chunk_text": "Hon. Minister, I discussed with you regarding the Kandy City Wastewater Management Project. Also, you all target giving 12,000 pipe-borne water connections in Kandy, but still, you all have given only 3,000 connections. So, could you please clarify how you all are going to complete giving the rest, the balance 8,000 connections? Then, the community-based water supply projects in Walgampaya, Kirimetiya, Anditenna and Omandal have still not been completed. Hon. Minister, I have here with me a letter, which I will hand over to you. Please, Hon. Minister, try to complete all those projects with the allocations from this Budget.\n\nBasically, there are two institutions with which we have achieved the work: one is the National Water Supply and Drainage Board and the other is the Department of National Community Water Supply. As you are aware, all our projects did stall due to the economic crisis that went on and if you would notice, some of the projects that we had ongoing are 80 per cent above or 90 per cent above complete and regardless of the magnitude of which, they all have come to a standstill. For the past few weeks, the team and I have been working extensively on how we could restart those projects.\n\nI will be more than happy to have a meeting with both the Chairman of the National Water Supply and Drainage Board and also the DG of the Department of National Community Water Supply with regard to these issues right after this Discussion, if that is all right with you, and give you an answer.\n\nThank you.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dd2\u0da5 \u0dc0\u0dd9\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad \u0dba\u0dcf\u0db4\u0dcf\u0db6\u0dab\u0dca\u0da9\u0dcf\u0dbb \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bb0\u0bc8\u0bbf \u0bb5\u0b9a\u0ba8\u0bcd\u0ba4 \u0baf\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0baa\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0bb0) (The Hon. Wasantha Yapabandara, Attorney-at-Law) Thank you.\n\n711 712\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dda\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0\n\n\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0dd9\u0db7\u0dcf\u0db4\u0dad\u0dd2\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0ba4\u0bb5\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0bb3\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Chairman) \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0dc1\u0d9a\u0dca. \u0dc3\u0dd4\u0da2\u0dd2\u0dad\u0dca \u0dc3\u0d82\u0da2\u0dba \u0dc1\u0db4\u0dc1\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbb\u0dcf \u0db8\u0dd0\u0dad\u0dd2\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dcf. \u0dba\u0db6\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da7 \u0db8\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dd2\u0dad\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4 15\u0d9a \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dca \u0dad\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0db6\u0db1\u0dc0\u0dcf."
  },
